au14-trait-drugallergy-name = 随机药物过敏
au14-trait-drugallergy-desc = 你对几种常见药物中的一种过敏。摄入它会引发严重的过敏反应，直到用纳洛酮或肾上腺素治疗。你出生时带有一支肾上腺素注射器和一张注明你过敏的标签。
au14-drug-allergy-tag-name = 医疗警示标签
au14-drug-allergy-tag-text = 对 { $reagent } 过敏
au14-drugallergy-reaction = 你的喉咙发紧，皮肤发麻——有些非常不对劲！
au14-drugallergy-building = 随着反应在你体内蔓延，你的皮肤发麻。
au14-drugallergy-suffering = 你无法呼吸——你的身体正在衰竭！
au14-drugallergy-stun = 你的肌肉突然僵住了！
au14-drugallergy-cured = 随着药物起效，反应几乎瞬间消退。

au14-alert-allergicreaction-name = 过敏反应
au14-alert-allergicreaction-desc = 你正在遭受严重的过敏反应。立即用纳洛酮或肾上腺素治疗。
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-inaprovaline-name = Drug Allergy: Inaprovaline
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-paracetamol-name = Drug Allergy: Paracetamol
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-tramadol-name = Drug Allergy: Tramadol
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-oxycodone-name = Drug Allergy: Oxycodone
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-fentanyl-name = Drug Allergy: Fentanyl
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-imidazoline-name = Drug Allergy: Imidazoline
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-leporazine-name = Drug Allergy: Leporazine
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-ethylredoxrazine-name = Drug Allergy: Ethylredoxrazine
cmu-trait-drug-allergy-desc = You are allergic to this medication. Taking it triggers a serious allergic reaction until treated with epinephrine. You spawn with an epinephrine injector and a tag noting your allergy.
cmu-trait-category-drug-allergy = Allergies
cmu-drugallergy-examine = [color=#d77a3d]{ CAPITALIZE(POSS-ADJ($target)) } skin is blotchy and swollen, and { SUBJECT($target) } { CONJUGATE-BE($target) } wheezing for breath.[/color]
cmu-drugallergy-examine-severe = [color=#c33a3a]{ CAPITALIZE(POSS-ADJ($target)) } throat seems to be closing up and { SUBJECT($target) } can't breathe![/color]
